---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');

const environments = [
  ['Live production', 'Film, television, concerts, and deadline-driven logistics.'],
  ['Family offices', 'Bespoke processes, discretion, complex entities, and owner-level expectations.'],
  ['Real estate', 'Development draws, asset-level reporting, capital partners, and long project cycles.'],
  ['Aerospace', 'Launch services, technical programs, vendors, systems, and precision.'],
  ['Marketplace operations', 'Revenue flows, close processes, multi-jurisdiction activity, and recurring exceptions.'],
  ['Software products', 'Requirements, architecture choices, distributed teams, QA, Git, and iteration.'],
];
---

<section id="perspective" class="relative py-14 md:py-24">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-7 md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] md:gap-14">
      <p class="coord pt-1">05 / Operating perspective</p>
      <div>
        <h2 class="section-heading max-w-3xl text-3xl md:text-5xl">
          Different industries. Recurring system problems.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-copy mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base md:text-lg">
          My career has crossed environments with very different customers, assets, constraints,
          and definitions of success. That range makes it easier to see the patterns that repeat:
          fragmented data, manual handoffs, undocumented rules, approval bottlenecks, and valuable
          knowledge trapped in people rather than systems.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-hairline md:mt-14 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {environments.map(([title, body], index) => (
        <article class="bg-paper-soft/90 p-5 md:p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <p class="coord text-accent">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</p>
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-signal" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">{title}</h3>
          <p class="section-copy mt-3 text-sm">{body}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-paper-soft/60 p-5 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:p-7">
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg font-semibold leading-relaxed text-ink">
        The industries changed. The work kept returning to how people move money, information,
        assets, and decisions.
      </p>
      <a href={`${base}/about`} class="button-secondary shrink-0">
        Read the full story
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
